      "natural_statement": "Adversarially audit, verify, or refute OpenAI Manuscript Family 358 (A three-manifold without conjugate points or nonpositive curvature.; papers: A Three-Manifold Without Conjugate Points and Without a Nonpositively Curved Metric; Lean status: Partially/Comparator formalized (lean/docs/358.md)): either (a) discover and certify an explicit mathematical flaw, sign/orientation error, counterexample to an intermediate lemma, or statement-fidelity/citation gap with a deterministic symbolic/computational certificate (`verify.py` + `exact_certificate.json`), or (b) independently verify, repair, or generalize the manuscript's core mathematical theorem with a standalone machine-checkable certificate certified by the independent Reviewer.",
