      "natural_statement": "For every fixed smooth source-admissible cutoff chi, the staged cometric in both inward frames satisfies P positive definite, P double-prime negative semidefinite, norm(P), norm(P-prime)/delta <= C0, and |P-prime p|^2 <= C0 delta p^T(-P-double-prime)p for all 0<delta<=min(1/2,m/(2K2)); m,K2,C0 are explicitly defined in REPORT.md Section 1.",
