      "natural_statement": "For every smooth positive definite concave n-dimensional cometric and genuine transverse returning unit geodesic, if P-prime(0) is positive semidefinite, the unrestricted perpendicular index form has the attained exact endpoint reduction Iperp=R+X^T(S^-1+M-pp^T/L)X+C^T M C, with R>=0, M=v0 Q(0)P-prime(0)Q(0)/4 and S defined by the scalar Dirichlet ODE in REPORT.md Section 3. Thus it is nonnegative for all smooth fields if and only if p^T(S^-1+M)^-1 p<=L.",
