      "natural_statement": "For the actual cometric, the scalar-Dirichlet response matrix satisfies S(p,p)<=L(1+v0^2), S(e,e)<=3C0 L, and |S(p,e)-Lp1|<=5C0 delta L |p1| for all returning passages. All geometric hypotheses follow from C358_COMETRIC, not finite sampling.",
