      "natural_statement": "For every fixed source-admissible cutoff chi and every 0<delta<=delta_* of REPORT.md (1), every unit-speed returning passage of the actual staged cometric in either end frame has Iperp(V)>=0 for every smooth field with unrestricted endpoints. Deep returns satisfy Iperp>=9v0^2(E+mu X1^2)/140+mu C1^2 in the unrestricted affine gauge. For every return, equality holds exactly for V=c partial_y2+hT. The explicit fixed smooth cutoff in Section 1 permits every 0<delta<=10^-12.",
